                <mxCell id="16" value="&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;1039&quot; data-start=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Design Decisions&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Why mutex over channel?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Why monitor?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Why odd/even fork ordering?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Why cooperative cancellation?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
